<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CyberSec Dev | Full-Stack Developer & Cybersecurity Specialist</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- Firebase SDK -->
    <script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/9.22.1/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
    <script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/9.22.1/firebase-firestore-compat.js"></script>
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --neon-green: #0f0;
            --cyber-blue: #00f5ff;
            --electric-purple: #b300ff;
            --dark-bg: #0a0a0a;
            --darker-bg: #050505;
            --card-bg: rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.8);
            --text-light: #e0e0e0;
        }

        /* Light Mode Variables */
        [data-theme="light"] {
            --dark-bg: #f8f9fa;
            --darker-bg: #e9ecef;
            --card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            --text-light: #333333;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
            color: var(--text-light);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.6;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .code-font {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }

        /* Theme Toggle Button */
        .theme-toggle {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-green);
            color: var(--neon-green);
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }

        .theme-toggle:hover {
            background: rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.1);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-green);
        }

        .theme-toggle i {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        /* Navbar Styles */
        .navbar {
            background-color: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.2);
            padding: 1rem 0;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        [data-theme="light"] .navbar {
            background-color: rgba(248, 249, 250, 0.9);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .navbar-brand {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-green), var(--cyber-blue));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .nav-link {
            color: var(--text-light) !important;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin: 0 0.5rem;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            color: var(--neon-green) !important;
        }

        .nav-link::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -5px;
            left: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-green), var(--cyber-blue));
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-link:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, rgba(11, 29, 64, 0.4) 0%, transparent 50%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 70% 20%, rgba(51, 0, 102, 0.3) 0%, transparent 50%);
        }

        [data-theme="light"] .hero {
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, rgba(173, 216, 230, 0.4) 0%, transparent 50%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 70% 20%, rgba(221, 160, 221, 0.3) 0%, transparent 50%);
        }

        .hero-content {
            z-index: 2;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-green), var(--cyber-blue), var(--electric-purple));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .typing-text {
            border-right: 2px solid var(--neon-green);
            animation: blink 0.7s infinite;
            padding-right: 5px;
        }

        @keyframes blink {
            0%, 100% { border-color: var(--neon-green); }
            50% { border-color: transparent; }
        }

        .btn-cyber {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--neon-green);
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-green);
            padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            border-radius: 0;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            z-index: 1;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn-cyber::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: -100%;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.2), transparent);
            transition: left 0.5s ease;
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .btn-cyber:hover {
            color: var(--dark-bg);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--neon-green);
        }

        .btn-cyber:hover::before {
            left: 100%;
        }

        .btn-cyber-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-green), var(--cyber-blue));
            color: var(--dark-bg);
            border: none;
        }

        .btn-cyber-primary:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-green);
        }

        /* Section Styles */
        .section-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 100px;
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-green), var(--cyber-blue));
        }

        .section-bg {
            background-color: var(--darker-bg);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .section-bg::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, rgba(179, 0, 255, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        [data-theme="light"] .section-bg::before {
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, rgba(179, 0, 255, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
        }

        /* About Section */
        .about-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .glitch-effect {
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .glitch-effect::before,
        .glitch-effect::after {
            content: attr(data-text);
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .glitch-effect::before {
            left: 2px;
            text-shadow: -2px 0 var(--electric-purple);
            clip: rect(44px, 450px, 56px, 0);
            animation: glitch-anim 5s infinite linear alternate-reverse;
        }

        .glitch-effect::after {
            left: -2px;
            text-shadow: -2px 0 var(--cyber-blue);
            clip: rect(44px, 450px, 56px, 0);
            animation: glitch-anim2 5s infinite linear alternate-reverse;
        }

        @keyframes glitch-anim {
            0% { clip: rect(42px, 9999px, 44px, 0); }
            5% { clip: rect(12px, 9999px, 59px, 0); }
            10% { clip: rect(48px, 9999px, 29px, 0); }
            15% { clip: rect(42px, 9999px, 73px, 0); }
            20% { clip: rect(63px, 9999px, 27px, 0); }
            25% { clip: rect(34px, 9999px, 55px, 0); }
            30% { clip: rect(86px, 9999px, 73px, 0); }
            35% { clip: rect(20px, 9999px, 20px, 0); }
            40% { clip: rect(26px, 9999px, 60px, 0); }
            45% { clip: rect(25px, 9999px, 66px, 0); }
            50% { clip: rect(57px, 9999px, 98px, 0); }
            55% { clip: rect(5px, 9999px, 46px, 0); }
            60% { clip: rect(82px, 9999px, 31px, 0); }
            65% { clip: rect(54px, 9999px, 27px, 0); }
            70% { clip: rect(28px, 9999px, 99px, 0); }
            75% { clip: rect(45px, 9999px, 69px, 0); }
            80% { clip: rect(23px, 9999px, 85px, 0); }
            85% { clip: rect(54px, 9999px, 84px, 0); }
            90% { clip: rect(45px, 9999px, 47px, 0); }
            95% { clip: rect(37px, 9999px, 20px, 0); }
            100% { clip: rect(4px, 9999px, 91px, 0); }
        }

        @keyframes glitch-anim2 {
            0% { clip: rect(65px, 9999px, 100px, 0); }
            5% { clip: rect(52px, 9999px, 74px, 0); }
            10% { clip: rect(79px, 9999px, 85px, 0); }
            15% { clip: rect(75px, 9999px, 5px, 0); }
            20% { clip: rect(67px, 9999px, 61px, 0); }
            25% { clip: rect(14px, 9999px, 79px, 0); }
            30% { clip: rect(1px, 9999px, 66px, 0); }
            35% { clip: rect(86px, 9999px, 30px, 0); }
            40% { clip: rect(23px, 9999px, 98px, 0); }
            45% { clip: rect(85px, 9999px, 72px, 0); }
            50% { clip: rect(71px, 9999px, 75px, 0); }
            55% { clip: rect(2px, 9999px, 48px, 0); }
            60% { clip: rect(30px, 9999px, 16px, 0); }
            65% { clip: rect(59px, 9999px, 50px, 0); }
            70% { clip: rect(41px, 9999px, 62px, 0); }
            75% { clip: rect(2px, 9999px, 82px, 0); }
            80% { clip: rect(47px, 9999px, 73px, 0); }
            85% { clip: rect(3px, 9999px, 27px, 0); }
            90% { clip: rect(26px, 9999px, 55px, 0); }
            95% { clip: rect(42px, 9999px, 97px, 0); }
            100% { clip: rect(38px, 9999px, 49px, 0); }
        }

        /* Skills Section */
        .skill-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            height: 100%;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .skill-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: -100%;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.05), transparent);
            transition: left 0.5s ease;
        }

        .skill-card:hover::before {
            left: 100%;
        }

        .skill-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--neon-green);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .skill-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-green), var(--cyber-blue));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        /* Projects Section */
        .project-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .project-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: var(--neon-green);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .project-img {
            height: 200px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--electric-purple), var(--cyber-blue));
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .project-img::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');
        }

        .project-content {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .project-tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .project-tag {
            background: rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
            color: var(--cyber-blue);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }

        /* Contact Section */
        .contact-form {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .form-control {
            background-color: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.2);
            color: var(--text-light);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        }

        [data-theme="light"] .form-control {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            color: #333;
        }

        .form-control:focus {
            background-color: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.9);
            border-color: var(--neon-green);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.2rem rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.1);
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        [data-theme="light"] .form-control:focus {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);
            color: #333;
        }

        .form-label {
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        [data-theme="light"] .form-label {
            color: #333;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            background-color: var(--darker-bg);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 3rem 0 1.5rem;
        }

        .social-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .social-link {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
            color: var(--cyber-blue);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .social-link:hover {
            background: var(--neon-green);
            color: var(--dark-bg);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.3);
        }

        /* Matrix Background */
        .matrix-bg {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            opacity: 0.1;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Admin Panel Styles */
        .sidebar {
            background-color: var(--darker-bg);
            border-right: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .sidebar-header {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .sidebar .nav-link {
            color: var(--text-light);
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.05);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .sidebar .nav-link:hover, .sidebar .nav-link.active {
            color: var(--neon-green);
            background-color: rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .admin-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .admin-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .badge-cyber {
            background: rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
            color: var(--cyber-blue);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }

        .action-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin: 0 5px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .action-btn.edit:hover {
            color: var(--neon-green);
        }

        .action-btn.delete:hover {
            color: #ff4757;
        }

        .stats-number {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .stats-card .stats-title {
            color: var(--cyber-blue);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .update-alert {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: var(--neon-green);
            color: var(--dark-bg);
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: 500;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.3);
            display: none;
        }

        /* Login Styles */
        .login-container {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            z-index: 9999;
            display: none;
        }

        .login-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .login-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .divider {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }

        .divider::before,
        .divider::after {
            content: '';
            flex: 1;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .divider span {
            padding: 0 1rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .close-login {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            right: 15px;
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .close-login:hover {
            color: var(--neon-green);
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
            
            .hero p {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }
            
            .section-title {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Main Website -->
    <div id="main-website">
        <!-- Navigation -->
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark fixed-top">
            <div class="container">
                <a class="navbar-brand code-font" href="#">CyberSec<span style="color: var(--neon-green);">Dev</span></a>
                <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav">
                    <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
                </button>
                <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
                    <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" href="#home">Home</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" href="#about">About</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" href="#skills">Skills</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" href="#projects">Projects</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <a class="nav-link" href="#contact">Contact</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item d-flex align-items-center">
                            <a class="nav-link btn-cyber ms-2" href="#" onclick="showLogin()">Admin Login</a>
                            <button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" title="Toggle Light/Dark Mode">
                                <i class="fas fa-moon"></i>
                            </button>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section id="home" class="hero">
            <canvas class="matrix-bg" id="matrixCanvas"></canvas>
            <div class="container hero-content">
                <div class="row align-items-center">
                    <div class="col-lg-6">
                        <h1>Full-Stack Developer & <span class="glitch-effect" data-text="Cybersecurity Specialist">Cybersecurity Specialist</span></h1>
                        <p class="typing-text" id="typing-text">Building secure digital solutions for the future.</p>
                        <div class="mt-4">
                            <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-cyber btn-cyber-primary me-3">View My Work</a>
                            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-cyber">Get In Touch</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-6 text-center">
                        <div class="hero-illustration">
                            <div class="project-img" style="height: 300px; border-radius: 10px;">
                                <i class="fas fa-lock" style="font-size: 8rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);"></i>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- About Section -->
        <section id="about" class="py-5 section-bg">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-6">
                        <div class="about-content">
                            <h3 class="mb-4">Hello, I'm <span style="color: var(--neon-green);" id="aboutName">Eng.yassa hanna</span></h3>
                            <p class="mb-4" id="aboutContent">I'm a passionate full-stack developer and cybersecurity specialist with over 7 years of experience building secure, scalable web applications and protecting digital assets from modern threats.</p>
                            <p class="mb-4">My journey began in ethical hacking, which evolved into a passion for creating robust applications that prioritize security from the ground up.</p>
                            <div class="row mt-5">
                                <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                    <h5 class="code-font" style="color: var(--cyber-blue);">Name:</h5>
